stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Locked
  Locked --> Preview: dry run
  Locked --> Configured: configure rules and digest
  Configured --> Frozen: contest already frozen
  Configured --> Scheduled: schedule is due
  Scheduled --> Downloading: fetch submission metadata and workshop items
  Downloading --> Validating: inspect downloaded archives
  Downloading --> Deferred: transient failure
  Validating --> Finalizing: persist validation outcomes
  Finalizing --> Published: build final archive and playlist
  Finalizing --> Deferred: processing error
  Published --> [*]
  Preview --> [*]
  Frozen --> [*]
